  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Bu Xiaogu meets her college ex-boyfriend after realising he was the one who posted Chun Yuqiao's graduation photo online. Listen to Xiaogu tell him off and close that chapter of her past.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于乔的照片是你发网上的吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你无不无聊啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "咱俩都分手两年了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你说什么呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我只是仰慕他的成就。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你想多了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "算了吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你现在也毕业了，也要去找工作了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我也知道我的工作离不了这儿。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "反正以后见不到面了，彻底放手吧。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于乔的照片是你发网上的吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You were the one who posted Chun Yuqiao's photo online, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你无不无聊啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Have you nothing better to do?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "咱俩都分手两年了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The two of us broke up two years ago.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你说什么呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What are you talking about?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我只是仰慕他的成就。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I simply admire his achievements.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你想多了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are overthinking it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "算了吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Forget it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你现在也毕业了，也要去找工作了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You have graduated now too, and need to look for a job.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我也知道我的工作离不了这儿。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I also know my work keeps me right here.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "反正以后见不到面了，彻底放手吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Since we will not see each other again, let us let go completely.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
